 (GRE) – Not Required\". Siebel FAQ also says GRE scores are not required. [Verifier note: siebelschool.illinois.edu responds slowly to the verifier user agent (sometimes >15s); snippet printed FOUND on retry on 2026-11-24.]"}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":null,"source_url":null,"evidence_snippet":null,"fetched_at":null}'::jsonb, '{"value":"No exemption for a Pakistani degree: exemptions apply only to a degree, two years of study or two years of work in the U.S. or an approved English-primary country, and Pakistan is not on the approved list.","source_url":"https://grad.illinois.edu/admissions/international-applicants","evidence_snippet":"Illinois Graduate Admissions recognizes the following countries as having English as the primary language: Australia, Bahamas, Barbados, Belize, Bermuda, Canada, Dominica, Fiji, Gambia, Ghana, Grenada, Guyana, Ireland, Jamaica, Kenya, Lesotho, Malawi, New Zealand, Nigeria, Philippines, Scotland","fetched_at":"2026-11-24","review_note":"Proposed from the official page on 2026-11-24 and checked by a second reviewer. Awaiting human review. The list is alphabetical and goes from Nigeria to Philippines, so Pakistan is not on it. Same page: exempt if ''Received a post-secondary degree from a U.S. institution (or an institution within an approved country) within five years of the proposed admission term'', or two years of study or of professional work in the U.S. or an approved country within five years. No medium-of-instruction route is listed."}'::jsonb, '{"value":"grad-admissions@siebelschool.illinois.edu","source_url":"https://siebelschool.illinois.edu/admissions/graduate/applications-process-requirements","evidence_snippet":"Graduate Admissions grad-admissions@siebelschool.illinois.edu","fetched_at":"2026-11-24","review_note":"Proposed from the official page on 2026-11-24 and checked by a second reviewer. Awaiting human review. Siebel School graduate admissions contact (page footer/contact block). [Verifier note: siebelschool.illinois.edu responds slowly to the verifier user agent (sometimes >15s); snippet printed FOUND on retry on 2026-11-24.]"}'::jsonb, '2026-11-24'::date),
